# --- Undergrowth and dead wood near the start (within 250 m). ---
plant trees/spruce_young
group undergrowth
spacing 4
density 0.0016
scale 0.5 1.3
slope 0 30 4
moisture 0.2 1 0.1
water_depth 0 0 0.01
patch 60 0.5
area 250

plant trees/pine_young
